The '''Frozen Chicken''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]]. It gives {{Stat|spd|+1}} when held in the player's [[Accessory Bag]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Frozen Chicken''' is obtained from {{NPCSprite|Gulliver}} after completing the third Cluckpoint of the [[Chicken Race]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

In case the player loses it, the '''Frozen Chicken''' can be repurchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{c|1000000}}.

