== Trivia ==
* The Accessory gives the same amount of speed as the {{Item|Speed Talisman}} without any upgrade, unlocked in the {{CollectionLink|Sugar Cane II}} collection.
* Like all Accessories earned from [[Races]], with the exception of the [[Lynx Talisman]] and [[Cheetah Talisman]], it gives only {{Stat|spd|+1}}.

